-- books/crystals/practice.rofl — what one crawl over a practice (parenting)
-- left behind as vocabulary. Loaded after base.rofl; independent of
-- software-product.rofl, which the same book also loads to test it.

crystal(practice).

-- How is X done: the styles, techniques and approaches a practice is
-- carried out by. Spawned by the owner in round 6 of parenting, when the
-- eight practices and the Baumrind styles had been filed as PARTS of
-- parenting (decomposes_into) and were nothing of the kind: a style is
-- not a component, it is a way.
archetype(method).            q_shape(method, out).
origin(method, "session:2026-09-20-parenting", enumerations_filed_as_parts).

-- Nothing learned yet: one seed, five rounds, no class at n >= 3 when this
